  "mark": {
    "description": "Caelum, the constellation, drawn as a lightning bolt. Its four main stars (delta, alpha, beta, gamma Caeli, which form a bent line in the sky) sit at the bolt's four turning points and the constellation line is the bolt's zigzag spine. The bolt is a neon outline in the cyan→violet→purple gradient with a soft glow; a chamfered C, drawn as an outlined neon letter, sits in the centre.",
